  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who hold or are exposed to simplistic, reductive, and often Islamophobic narratives about terrorism and the Middle East. This includes those who believe in the stereotype that terrorism is primarily sponsored by Saudi Arabia (terrorism_sponsorship_stereotype) and who may be receptive to violent solutions (violent_solution_stereotype). The meme is designed to provoke outrage and simplify complex geopolitical issues, appealing to audiences who support or are influenced by extremist or hate-driven rhetoric. The audience is likely to be those who are already predisposed to Islamophobia or who are seeking emotionally charged, binary solutions to complex problems, as the meme’s visual metaphor (crater as destruction) is intended to incite hatred and support for violent annihilation.",
